# SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-3.0-or-later
# A stutter on demand: G5 tapped (let go within a 16th), on any screen. Each tap the next kind: a simple one, a complex
# one, none; G5 blinks while one waits, slowly for a simple one (400 ms), quickly for a complex one (125 ms). It plays
# on the next group's last bar that isn't an intro's or an outro's, then G5 goes dark. The first song is 56 bars at
# 81 BPM (2963 ms a bar): an 8-bar intro, four 8-bar grooves (no lead), two lead blocks. Queued in the intro's second
# bar, it waits out the intro and lands on the first groove's last bar (bar 16, from 0: 15), a bar the song's own
# stutters skip (its first pass without the lead).
listen
wait 1400
tap PLAY
wait 3000
expect stutter 0
expect stutter_blink 0
# a tap: a simple one
tapkey 26
wait 50
said STUTTER SIMPLE
expect stutter 1
expect stutter_blink 400
expect hold -1
# again while it waits: a complex one
tapkey 26
wait 50
said STUTTER COMPLEX
expect stutter 2
expect stutter_blink 125
# a third: cancelled, G5 dark
tapkey 26
wait 50
said STUTTER OFF
expect stutter 0
expect stutter_blink 0
expect key_lit <67108864
# on another screen too (Sections): twice, a complex one
tap SEL
wait 50
said SECTIONS
tapkey 26
wait 50
tapkey 26
wait 50
said STUTTER COMPLEX
expect stutter 2
shot stutter-queued.png
# the intro passes; it waits, G5 blinking (bar 12, from 0: 11, about 34.6 s in)
wait 29496
expect section 1
expect stutter 2
expect stutter_blink 125
expect stutter_bar -1
# the first groove's last bar (bar 16, from 0: 15; 45.9-48.9 s): it lands there, a complex figure
wait 12800
expect bar 15
expect stutter_bar 15
expect stutter_fig >2
expect stutter 2
# its replays (the bar's 15th 16th, about 48.6 s): the mix stutters
wait 1050
expect stuttering 1
# the next bar: played, OFF again, nothing waiting
wait 2000
expect bar 16
expect stutter 0
expect stutter_bar -1
expect stutter_blink 0
shot stutter-played.png
# stopped, a tap queues one all the same (G5 blinks); PLAY: the song goes on from there, the stutter waiting in it
tap PLAY
wait 300
expect playing 0
tapkey 26
wait 50
said STUTTER SIMPLE
expect stutter 1
expect stutter_blink 400
tap PLAY
wait 1500
expect playing 1
expect stutter 1
